{"title": "拷回 .ibd 后 IMPORT 挂回，三行数据完整恢复", "lines": [
  {"t": "note", "s": "拷回备份并修正属主，root 属主 mysql 进程读不了"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "chown mysql:mysql /var/lib/mysql/mydb/mytable.ibd"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "ALTER TABLE mytable IMPORT TABLESPACE;"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "无报错即挂载成功，查询验收："},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "SELECT * FROM mytable;"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "id\tname"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "1\talice"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "2\tbob"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "3\tcarol"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：mysql:8.0.46 容器（2026-09）"}
]}
